### Troubleshooting Guide

**Common Issues and Solutions**:

| Problem | Cause | Solution | Prevention |
|---------|-------|----------|-----------|
| Missing correlation IDs | Middleware not installed | Run validation: `npm run validate:logging` | Pre-deployment checklist |
| Correlation ID not propagating | HTTP client missing header | Add correlation ID to all outbound calls | Code review pattern |
| Context bleed | AsyncLocalStorage not cleaned up | Ensure `enterWith()` called once per request | Load testing + concurrent tests |
| High latency | Synchronous log processing | Use async log transport | Performance baseline testing |
| Storage full | No retention policy | Implement retention and deletion | Infrastructure validation |
| Missing logs | Network connectivity issue | Test connection to aggregator | Pre-deployment validation |

