### C. Troubleshooting Guide

| Issue | Cause | Solution |
|-------|-------|----------|
| Correlation ID undefined in logs | AsyncLocalStorage not initialized | Check middleware order - correlationIdMiddleware must be first |
| Correlation ID not in response header | Middleware not applied | Verify middleware registered in server setup |
| Performance degradation | Sync logging transport | Enable async transport, disable pretty-printing |
| Different IDs for same request | Using uuidv4() in multiple places | Generate once in middleware, reuse |
| Memory leak in logs | Unbounded log queue | Check Pino transport configuration, set max queue size |
| Context lost in async ops | Improper async handling | Use setCorrelationIdAsync wrapper for promises |

