### 5.3 Feature Flags for Gradual Rollout

**Feature Flag Strategy** (for extra safety):

Instead of deploying to all endpoints at once, use feature flags to enable correlation ID logging per endpoint.

```java
// Java example using feature flag library (Spring Cloud Config, LaunchDarkly, etc.)
