public ResponseEntity<User> getUser(@PathVariable String id) {
    if (featureFlags.isEnabled("correlation-id-logging")) {
        String correlationId = MDC.get("correlation_id");
        log.info("Fetching user with correlation context",
            Map.of("correlation_id", correlationId));
    } else {
        log.info("Fetching user (legacy logging)");
    }
    return ResponseEntity.ok(userService.getUser(id));
}
```

**Feature Flag Rollout Plan:**

- Day 1: Enable on 10% of requests
- Day 2: Increase to 50% if no issues
- Day 3: Enable on 100% of requests

This provides extra confidence and easier rollback (just disable flag, no redeployment needed).

