| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| `correlation_id` is `null` or empty | Check middleware registration order; correlation ID filter must run first (check `@Order` or middleware order) |
| Logs not in JSON format | Verify log formatter is set to JSON (not text format). Check `logback.xml` or Python formatter config |
| No `correlation_id` field in output | Manually check MDC/context is populated in handler. Add debug log: `log.debug("Current correlation_id: {}", MDC.get("correlation_id"))` |
